# Master MRW Dashboard

When working on the Master MRW Dashboard or its modules, refer to `docs/MASTER_MRW_DASHBOARD_SPEC.md` and `docs/MASTER_MRW_LAYOUT_LOCKED.md`.

## Layout: Explicit X/Y Coordinates (REQUIRED)

**Every element's position MUST be set with explicit X/Y coordinates.** No flexbox, no `margin-left: auto`, no wraps for layout.

- Use `position: absolute` with explicit `top`, `left`, and/or `right` (in px) for every label, value, and unit
- Example: `style="position:absolute;top:9px;left:16px;"` or `style="position:absolute;top:129px;right:116px;text-align:right;width:120px;"`
- Do NOT use flex rows, `rainValWrap`, `margin-left: auto`, or `display: flex` for positioning
- See temp and humidity modules for the pattern; see rain module for a corrected example
- Rain module: LOCKED. DO NOT move the labels. Values left 404 right 186; inch marks inline; in/hr stacked.
- Air Quality module: LOCKED. Missing data → `--` only. Never "Data Unavailable".
- Celestial module: LOCKED. Row 1: Sunrise|Sunset|Length. Row 2: Moonrise|Moonset|Phase. Row 3: Next Season. See docs/MASTER_MRW_LAYOUT_LOCKED.md.

## Quick Context

- LAN-only, 32" 4K, Windows Beelink
- Modular: local realtime (pi-wx) + embedded radar products
- Data: pi-wx `http://192.168.2.174/data/` via /pi-wx-data proxy
